\" style=\"mso-ligatures:none;mso-fareast-language:CA\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p>\n<table class=\"MsoNormalTable\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" width=\"100%\" style=\"width:100.0%;border-collapse:collapse\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"227\" style=\"width:6.0cm;border:none;border-bottom:solid gray 1.0pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 0cm\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"right\" style=\"text-align:right\"><b><span style=\"font-size:9.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#2E75B6;mso-fareast-language:CA\">C</span></b><span style=\"font-size:9.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#7F7F7F;mso-fareast-language:CA\">onsorci\n d&#8217;</span><b><span style=\"font-size:9.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#2E75B6;mso-fareast-language:CA\">A</span></b><span style=\"font-size:9.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#7F7F7F;mso-fareast-language:CA\">igües de\n</span><b><span style=\"font-size:9.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#2E75B6;mso-fareast-language:CA\">T</span></b><span style=\"font-size:9.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#7F7F7F;mso-fareast-language:CA\">arragona</span><span style=\"color:#1F497D;mso-fareast-language:CA\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\n</td>\n<td width=\"11\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:8.5pt;border:none;border-bottom:solid gray 1.0pt;padding:0cm 0cm 0cm 0cm\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#2E75B6;mso-fareast-language:CA\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color:#1F497D;mso-fareast-language:CA\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\n</td>\n<td width=\"265\" style=\"width:7.0cm;border:none;border-bottom:solid gray 1.0pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:8.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#595959;mso-fareast-language:CA\">Jordi Martínez</span></b><span style=\"color:#1F497D;mso-fareast-language:CA\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"border:none;border-bottom:solid gray 1.0pt;padding:0cm 0cm 0cm 0cm\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#1F497D;mso-fareast-language:CA\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color:#1F497D;mso-fareast-language:CA\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height:3.55pt\">\n<td width=\"227\" style=\"width:6.0cm;border:none;border-right:solid white 1.0pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 0cm;height:3.55pt\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"right\" style=\"text-align:right\"><b><span style=\"font-size:7.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#7F7F7F;mso-fareast-language:CA\">Instal·lacions Centrals</span></b><span style=\"color:#1F497D;mso-fareast-language:CA\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\n</td>\n<td width=\"11\" style=\"width:8.5pt;border-top:none;border-left:none;border-bottom:solid white 1.0pt;border-right:solid white 1.0pt;background:#DEEAF6;padding:0cm 0cm 0cm 0cm;height:3.55pt\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:7.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#7F7F7F;mso-fareast-language:CA\">&nbsp;</span></b><span style=\"color:#1F497D;mso-fareast-language:CA\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\n</td>\n<td width=\"265\" style=\"width:7.0cm;padding:0cm 0cm 0cm 5.4pt;height:3.55pt\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:7.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#7F7F7F;mso-fareast-language:CA\">ITE</span></b><b><span style=\"font-size:8.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#2E75B6;mso-fareast-language:CA\">&nbsp;</span></b><span style=\"color:#1F497D;mso-fareast-language:CA\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"padding:0cm 0cm 0cm 0cm;height:3.55pt\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#1F497D;mso-fareast-language:CA\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color:#1F497D;mso-fareast-language:CA\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height:11.35pt\">\n<td width=\"227\" style=\"width:6.0cm;border:none;border-right:solid white 1.0pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 0cm;height:11.35pt\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"right\" style=\"text-align:right\"><span style=\"font-size:7.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#7F7F7F;mso-fareast-language:CA\">Autovia T11 Km14, 43006 Tarragona</span><span style=\"color:#1F497D;mso-fareast-language:CA\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\n</td>\n<td width=\"11\" style=\"width:8.5pt;border-top:none;border-left:none;border-bottom:solid white 1.0pt;border-right:solid white 1.0pt;background:#BDD6EE;padding:0cm 0cm 0cm 0cm;height:11.35pt\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:8.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#7F7F7F;mso-fareast-language:CA\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color:#1F497D;mso-fareast-language:CA\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\n</td>\n<td width=\"265\" style=\"width:7.0cm;padding:0cm 0cm 0cm 5.4pt;height:11.35pt\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:7.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#7F7F7F;mso-fareast-language:CA\">Enginyer de dades&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color:#1F497D;mso-fareast-language:CA\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"padding:0cm 0cm 0cm 0cm;height:11.35pt\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#1F497D;mso-fareast-language:CA\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color:#1F497D;mso-fareast-language:CA\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height:11.35pt\">\n<td width=\"227\" style=\"width:6.0cm;border:none;border-right:solid white 1.0pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 0cm;height:11.35pt\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"right\" style=\"text-align:right\"><span style=\"font-size:7.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#7F7F7F;mso-fareast-language:CA\">Tel. 977546410 &nbsp;/&nbsp; Fax 977546240</span><span style=\"color:#1F497D;mso-fareast-language:CA\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\n</td>\n<td width=\"11\" style=\"width:8.5pt;border-top:none;border-left:none;border-bottom:solid white 1.0pt;border-right:solid white 1.0pt;background:#9CC2E5;padding:0cm 0cm 0cm 0cm;height:11.35pt\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:7.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#7F7F7F;mso-fareast-language:CA\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color:#1F497D;mso-fareast-language:CA\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\n</td>\n<td width=\"265\" style=\"width:7.0cm;padding:0cm 0cm 0cm 5.4pt;height:11.35pt\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:7.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#7F7F7F;mso-fareast-language:CA\">Tel. 977636254</span><span style=\"color:#1F497D;mso-fareast-language:CA\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"padding:0cm 0cm 0cm 0cm;height:11.35pt\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#1F497D;mso-fareast-language:CA\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color:#1F497D;mso-fareast-language:CA\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height:11.35pt\">\n<td width=\"227\" style=\"width:6.0cm;border-top:none;border-left:none;border-bottom:solid gray 1.0pt;border-right:solid white 1.0pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 0cm;height:11.35pt\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"right\" style=\"text-align:right\"><span style=\"font-size:7.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#2E75B6;mso-fareast-language:CA\"><a href=\"mailto:cat@ccaait.cat\"><span style=\"color:#2E75B6\">cat@ccaait.cat</span></a> &nbsp;/ &nbsp;<a href=\"http://www.ccaait.cat/\"><span style=\"color:#2E75B6\">www.ccaait.cat</span></a></span><span style=\"font-size:7.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#7F7F7F;mso-fareast-language:CA\">\n</span><span style=\"color:#1F497D;mso-fareast-language:CA\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\n</td>\n<td width=\"11\" style=\"width:8.5pt;border-top:none;border-left:none;border-bottom:solid gray 1.0pt;border-right:solid white 1.0pt;background:#2E74B5;padding:0cm 0cm 0cm 0cm;height:11.35pt\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:7.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#7F7F7F;mso-fareast-language:CA\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color:#1F497D;mso-fareast-language:CA\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\n</td>\n<td width=\"265\" style=\"width:7.0cm;border:none;border-bottom:solid gray 1.0pt;padding:0cm 0cm 0cm 5.4pt;height:11.35pt\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:7.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#2E75B6;mso-fareast-language:CA\"><a href=\"mailto:jmartinez@ccaait.cat\"><span style=\"color:#0563C1\">jmartinez@ccaait.cat</span></a>\n</span><span style=\"color:#1F497D;mso-fareast-language:CA\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"border:none;border-bottom:solid gray 1.0pt;padding:0cm 0cm 0cm 0cm;height:11.35pt\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#1F497D;mso-fareast-language:CA\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color:#1F497D;mso-fareast-language:CA\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"ES\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#1F497D;mso-fareast-language:CA\">&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"ES\" style=\"color:#1F497D;mso-fareast-language:CA\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\n<table class=\"MsoNormalTable\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" width=\"100%\" style=\"width:100.0%;border-collapse:collapse\">\n<tbody>\n<tr style=\"height:4.0pt\">\n<td width=\"100%\" style=\"width:100.0%;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;height:4.0pt\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:7.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#A6A6A6;mso-fareast-language:CA\">La informació continguda en aquest correu electrònic és confidencial i s&#8217;adreça exclusivament al seu destinatari. La seva divulgació està\n prohibida. En cas d&#8217;haver-lo rebut per equivocació, els demanem que el destrueixin i ens ho comuniquin. Gràcies per la seva col·laboració.</span><span style=\"color:#1F497D;mso-fareast-language:CA\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height:4.0pt\">\n<td width=\"100%\" style=\"width:100.0%;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;height:4.0pt\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:7.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#2E75B6;mso-fareast-language:CA\">Pel medi ambient, val la pena imprimir aquest correu?</span><span style=\"color:#1F497D;mso-fareast-language:CA\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"ES\" style=\"mso-fareast-language:CA\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>",
